[36m(TaskRunner pid=592655)[0m code='# experiments/solution.py\n\ndef get_pell(n):\n    """\n    Calculate the nth Pell number using the recurrence relation P(n) = 2*P(n-1) + P(n-2)\n    with initial conditions P(0) = 0 and P(1) = 1.\n    \n    Args:\n        n (int): The index of the Pell number to compute.\n        \n    Returns:\n        int: The nth Pell number.\n    """\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    a, b = 0, 1\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, 2 * b + a\n    return b'
