[36m(TaskRunner pid=592655)[0m code='\ndef get_max_sum(n):\n    """\n    Compute the maximum sum by recursively calculating the maximum of the sum of four subproblems and n itself.\n\n    Parameters:\n    n (int): The input integer to compute the maximum sum for.\n\n    Returns:\n    int: The maximum between the sum of the four subproblems and n.\n    """\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    sub1 = get_max_sum(n // 2)\n    sub2 = get_max_sum(n // 3)\n    sub3 = get_max_sum(n // 4)\n    sub4 = get_max_sum(n // 5)\n    sum_sub = sub1 + sub2 + sub3 + sub4\n    return max(sum_sub, n)\n'
